Foreign function declaration is rejected
alien javascript "fun.js" f : () ~> (); f()
stderr : @.*Parse error:.*
exit : 1

Foreign declaration block is rejected
alien javascript "fun.js" { f : () ~> (); }
stderr : @.*Parse error:.*
exit : 1

Client function annotation is rejected
fun f() client { 42 } f()
stderr : @.*Parse error:.*
exit : 1

Server function annotation is rejected
fun f() server { 42 } f()
stderr : @.*Parse error:.*
exit : 1

Former location keywords are identifiers
var client = 40; var server = 2; client + server
stdout : 42 : Int

