Angle brackets still work in comparison operators
(1<2, 2>1, 1<=1, 2>=2)
stdout : (true, true, true, true) : (Bool, Bool, Bool, Bool)

Handler patterns still accept adjacent angle brackets
handle(do Ask) { case <Ask=>k> -> k(42) }
stdout : 42 : Int
args : --enable-handlers

Angle brackets still work inside a regular expression
"<tag>" =~ /<tag>/
stdout : true : Bool

Database generator still accepts a left arrow
fun f(t) { query { for (x <-- t) [(a=x.a)] } } ()
stdout : () : ()
